<opsproc code="00021893.0007001" revdate="2018-05-17T19:16:49"><title>CDLS Normal System</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.001"><title>Procedure to be developed in the Operator's MEL</title><procbody lid="N.00021893.0007001.002"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.003"><para code="00021893.0007001.001" layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.004">Alternate procedure must be
established and used to secure the cockpit and to access to the cockpit
in accordance with the Operator’s security policy.</para></inform><inform layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.005"><para code="00021893.0007001.002" layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.006">This alternate procedure may consider the use of deadbolt or any
other acceptable means approved by the National Aviation Authority.</para></inform><inform layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.007"><noteproc code="00021893.0007001.003" layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.008"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.009"><para code="00021893.0007001.004" layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.010">In the case of rapid decompression
in the cockpit, the use of the deadbolt prevents the automatic opening
of the cockpit door.</para></inform></noteproc></inform></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.011"><title>General information</title><procbody lid="N.00021893.0007001.012"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.013"><para code="00021893.0007001.005" layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.014">Since the <abb>CDLS</abb> Normal
system is deactivated, the keypad becomes inoperative.</para></inform><inform layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.015"><para code="00021893.0007001.006" layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.016">The flight crew must brief the cabin crew that the <abb>CDLS</abb> keypad is inoperative.</para></inform><inform layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.017"><para code="00021893.0007001.007" layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.018">For a request access to the
cockpit, use the cabin interphone.</para></inform></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.035"><title>During cockpit preparation</title><procbody lid="N.00021893.0007001.036"><action layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.037" memory="false"><cr-action code="00021893.0007001.014"><challenge><tech-label type="sw">LKG SYS</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.038"><title>In flight</title><procbody lid="N.00021893.0007001.039"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.040"><para code="00021893.0007001.015" layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.041">At least two crewmembers must
be present in the cockpit at all times during the flight.</para></inform><condition at-any-time="false" code="00021893.0007001.016" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.042" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro> If the deadbolt is used:</intro><procbody lid="N.00021893.0007001.043"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.044"><para code="00021893.0007001.017" layer="1" lid="N.00021893.0007001.045">The flight crew has to manually open the cockpit door. Therefore,
the access to the cockpit should be limited to the minimum necessary.</para></inform></procbody></condition></procbody></procitem></opsproc>